      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "お薬を作るために必要な材料を手に入れて\nほしいのです。こんな時勢ですし、\n少し調達が難しい品だとは思うのですが、\nなにとぞお願いいたしますわ。",
        "official_en": "I need your help to obtain the ingredients necessary \nto make medicine. There are shortages everywhere,\nand it may be difficult to obtain some of them,\nso I would greatly appreciate your help.",
